This licence covers the integration this repository adds: the waterbox/
driver, scripts and shims. The patches/ directory modifies xemu, a fork of
QEMU, and is offered under xemu's own terms (GPL-2.0-or-later); the built
core as a whole is distributed under the GPL. The vendored third-party
pieces keep their own terms - see waterbox/package-licenses.json.
